OL,3,GNEWSAPasser-by rescues driver from
OL,4,Asubmerged car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver whose car became submerged
OL,7,Fafter it entered Whitby Harbour has
OL,8,Fbeen rescued by a passer-by.
OL,10,FThe incident happened at about 11:50
OL,11,FBST on Friday, with the rescue taking
OL,12,Fplace prior to the arrival of emergency
OL,13,Fservices.
OL,15,FFire crews from Whitby and Lythe, as
OL,16,Fwell as the coastguard and police,
OL,17,Fattended the scene.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
