OL,3,GNEWSAPasser-by rescues driver from
OL,4,Asubmerged car
OL,5,
OL,6,FImmediate emergency care was
OL,7,Fadministered before the arrival of
OL,8,Fambulance crews and the driver was then
OL,9,Ftaken to hospital for treatment,
OL,10,Faccording to North Yorkshire Fire and
OL,11,FRescue Service.
